1
00:00:02,030 --> 00:00:07,620
Goal! Hamburg's second goal! Wakashimazu again doesn't react.

2
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:10,120
What!?

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,130
Look at the incredible power of that Schneider fire shot.

4
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:20,470
During camp I stood against the captain's Tiger Shot many times.

5
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:25,810
Even though I couldn't catch any, I could at least react.

6
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:31,810
But this shot accelerated near my hands.

7
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:35,520
A Tiger Shot plus an acceleration effect.

8
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:40,900
It's hard to admit, but this shot is better than the captain's Tiger Shot.

9
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:46,530
Score 2-0, Japan's youth are two goals down.

10
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:54,380
I told you to get ready for the national tournament in France, I know.

11
00:00:54,710 --> 00:00:58,800
But you don't intend to play right after getting off the plane, do you?

12
00:00:59,210 --> 00:01:01,630
What? That's why I'm here.

13
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:04,720
I'll bear the hardship.

14
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:06,850
I have to play now.

15
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:10,390
You haven't changed at all, football kid.

16
00:01:18,610 --> 00:01:21,110
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

17
00:02:41,610 --> 00:02:45,500
Episode 3: Professional Warrior

18
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:57,570
This is his new office, it must be lunchtime.

19
00:02:57,650 --> 00:03:02,320
If I ask now, maybe we can catch the second half of Karl's match.

20
00:03:03,370 --> 00:03:04,410
Honey...

21
00:03:12,750 --> 00:03:15,550
The attacks are just beginning. Catch.

22
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:18,380
Will Schneider score the third goal?

23
00:03:18,460 --> 00:03:19,800
I won't let you shoot!

24
00:03:23,050 --> 00:03:26,470
Oh, he shoots with his heel!

25
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,430
What?

26
00:03:29,850 --> 00:03:34,400
A dive! Wakashimazu uses his karate direct strike defense.

27
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:35,730
- What? - Great!

28
00:03:35,820 --> 00:03:37,360
Great catch, Wakashimazu.

29
00:03:37,780 --> 00:03:41,450
Izawa, Sorimachi, Sano, start warming up.

30
00:03:41,530 --> 00:03:42,610
Yes, coach.

31
00:03:47,790 --> 00:03:49,200
Good one, goalkeeper.

32
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:55,210
I thought we'd get more shots. Wakabayashi was right, they are strong.

33
00:03:55,330 --> 00:03:58,630
Yes, but not enough to beat us.

34
00:03:59,010 --> 00:04:00,340
It's obvious.

35
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:05,140
If we lose to amateurs like them, we'll be the laughingstock of the whole city.

36
00:04:05,390 --> 00:04:08,470
I'm sick of their stubborn attitude.

37
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:12,190
We've only conceded 2 goals, do they think they've won?

38
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:17,060
Bastards! The match isn't over yet.

39
00:04:19,610 --> 00:04:23,110
Looks like we can catch the second half.

40
00:04:23,990 --> 00:04:29,660
Great! I'll score against Wakabayashi-kun with my Drive Shot.

41
00:04:29,740 --> 00:04:31,040
Tsubasa.

42
00:04:31,540 --> 00:04:36,710
We need one more player in the Japan team alongside you.

43
00:04:38,340 --> 00:04:40,050
And that's Taro Misaki.

44
00:04:40,510 --> 00:04:41,760
Misaki-kun!

45
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:50,180
Without your golden duo, there is no Japan youth team.

46
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:54,440
In midfield, Matsuyama is holding the ball too tight.

47
00:04:54,730 --> 00:04:56,940
Only 5 minutes left.

48
00:04:57,020 --> 00:04:58,730
Send it here, Matsuyama.

49
00:04:59,630 --> 00:05:00,440
Hyuga.

50
00:05:02,490 --> 00:05:06,570
Hyuga breaks through the defense with his direct dribble.

51
00:05:06,780 --> 00:05:09,660
Kaltz-sama will cut him off.

52
00:05:09,910 --> 00:05:10,830
What?

53
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:14,830
He passed Kaltz! Up against Meier and Linz.

54
00:05:17,250 --> 00:05:18,670
Hyuga is in front of the goal.

55
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:22,300
This time, will Japan score through Toho's golden duo?

56
00:05:23,090 --> 00:05:27,050
The one-two can't be stopped. Göngerz clears the ball with a quick intervention.

57
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:28,550
The ball is still in play.

58
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:30,810
- Masao! - Okay.

59
00:05:32,100 --> 00:05:33,560
Space Storm!

60
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:34,930
This is the ground version.

61
00:05:36,060 --> 00:05:39,190
Wakabayashi read our move.

62
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:43,570
With a diving header, Tachibana passes to Hyuga.

63
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:45,860
Thanks, Tachibana.

64
00:05:47,530 --> 00:05:50,780
I won't waste this Space Storm pass.

65
00:05:50,870 --> 00:05:52,120
First, we need to score a goal.

66
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:56,870
So Wakabayashi, our penalty area duel will have to wait.

67
00:06:02,710 --> 00:06:03,630
Hyuga-san!

68
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:07,510
Again, Japan couldn't score.

69
00:06:09,510 --> 00:06:11,140
Are you okay, Hyuga?

70
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:16,980
You! You did this on purpose!

71
00:06:17,060 --> 00:06:20,270
That's the second time you've hit my stomach.

72
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:22,270
So what, Hyuga?

73
00:06:23,730 --> 00:06:27,150
I never thought I'd hear that from you.

74
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,150
Wakabayashi.

75
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:30,410
Football is a contact sport!

76
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:38,540
Hyuga.

77
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:39,670
Hyuga-san!

78
00:06:40,210 --> 00:06:42,460
We will win this match!

79
00:06:42,540 --> 00:06:44,710
Are you going to let them beat us?

80
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,880
Never!

81
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:48,800
We didn't come all the way from Japan to lose.

82
00:06:49,630 --> 00:06:50,840
Guys.

83
00:06:52,470 --> 00:06:55,140
Wakabayashi, ball please.

84
00:06:58,770 --> 00:07:02,610
And with this third goal, I'll finish the match.

85
00:07:05,690 --> 00:07:10,610
Schneider takes a surprise long shot from in front of his own goal.

86
00:07:10,860 --> 00:07:12,320
Don't underestimate me!

87
00:07:13,740 --> 00:07:18,080
This is a knife defense! Goalkeeper Ken Wakashimazu caught it!

88
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:19,660
Yes!

89
00:07:20,210 --> 00:07:22,420
The first half is over.

90
00:07:22,790 --> 00:07:27,420
That goalkeeper managed to catch the fire shot even from that distance.

91
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:33,970
It's an incredible shot, but we can't concede any more goals.

92
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:36,430
Let's do this, guys!

93
00:07:36,850 --> 00:07:37,770
Yeah!

94
00:07:37,850 --> 00:07:40,020
2 goals is nothing, we can make up for it.

95
00:07:40,100 --> 00:07:42,440
We'll settle the score in the second half, Hamburg.

96
00:07:42,850 --> 00:07:46,400
Japan Team, come at me with all your strength.

97
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:48,730
Get fired up and fight.

98
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:52,450
This is the first step to becoming a world team.

99
00:07:52,610 --> 00:07:55,950
Three years ago. It was the first day of training.

100
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:08,800
What's wrong? You have to do much better to survive.

101
00:08:09,260 --> 00:08:11,800
Pack your things with the ball and go back to Japan.

102
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:19,640
Heh, I think he fainted.

103
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:22,350
At least he lasted longer than the others.

104
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:23,940
Let's go.

105
00:08:24,020 --> 00:08:25,480
Not yet.

106
00:08:26,230 --> 00:08:31,150
Come on. I didn't come all the way from Japan just for fun.

107
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:33,490
So are you tired?

108
00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:36,740
Are you the best in Europe here?

109
00:08:37,030 --> 00:08:38,530
Y-you bastard.

110
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:40,870
I'll make you pay for this.

111
00:08:41,540 --> 00:08:42,370
Catch, here it comes.

112
00:08:48,500 --> 00:08:50,380
These aren't shots.

113
00:08:50,550 --> 00:08:52,010
Bastard!

114
00:08:52,090 --> 00:08:53,130
Stand aside.

115
00:08:53,550 --> 00:08:54,930
Schneider?

116
00:08:55,130 --> 00:08:56,260
Get ready, goalkeeper.

117
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:03,310
Did he stop it with his face?

118
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:07,560
Heh, I caught it.

119
00:09:09,820 --> 00:09:13,190
That was the first time I saw Schneider.

120
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:20,950
What's wrong?

121
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:26,960
I thought this would be the last time we play together on the same team.

122
00:09:27,420 --> 00:09:32,340
Right. We'll become enemies, Munich and Hamburg.

123
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:33,710
Yes.

124
00:09:34,130 --> 00:09:36,970
Just like Germany and Japan.

125
00:09:38,390 --> 00:09:41,470
I'd like to see more, but it's time.

126
00:09:42,310 --> 00:09:43,850
We're almost there.

127
00:09:44,140 --> 00:09:48,100
Hurry up, Marie. Your brother's match started a while ago.

128
00:09:48,310 --> 00:09:49,360
Okay.

129
00:09:49,940 --> 00:09:51,150
Marie.

130
00:09:58,320 --> 00:10:00,660
Are you okay? Are you hurt anywhere?

131
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:05,120
No, I'm fine. Are you okay?

132
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,160
Yes.

133
00:10:06,250 --> 00:10:07,500
Thank goodness.

134
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:11,290
It's my fault, we should take you to the hospital.

135
00:10:11,380 --> 00:10:17,130
I'm fine. Besides, I have to go back, or I'll miss the match.

136
00:10:17,590 --> 00:10:24,310
You must be Gino Hernandez, the goalkeeper of the Italian youth team.

137
00:10:25,310 --> 00:10:27,310
Italy's goalkeeper.

138
00:10:28,060 --> 00:10:32,940
Go score a goal. Get the first goal as the second half begins.

139
00:10:33,190 --> 00:10:35,110
That will determine the fate of this match.

140
00:10:35,190 --> 00:10:39,700
If we score one, it becomes 2-1, then we'll have a chance.

141
00:10:40,030 --> 00:10:43,200
Pull yourselves together. You are Japan's youth.

142
00:10:43,450 --> 00:10:47,330
Do whatever it takes to score a goal against Hamburg.

143
00:10:47,660 --> 00:10:48,710
Yes, coach!

144
00:10:50,210 --> 00:10:54,960
The second half of Japan youth vs Hamburg begins.

145
00:10:58,340 --> 00:11:01,220
Alright Tsubasa, it's your turn.

146
00:11:01,300 --> 00:11:02,220
Yeah!

147
00:11:05,620 --> 00:11:07,870
Born: December 7, Height: 170 cm, Weight: 63 kg, Blood Type: O

148
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:09,910
Kaltz steals the ball.

149
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:12,290
He's entering Japan's area.

150
00:11:12,750 --> 00:11:13,920
Got it.

151
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:14,830
What?

152
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:20,010
Izawa is on the field for Japan. He replaced Takasugi in the second half.

153
00:11:20,300 --> 00:11:21,590
Great, Izawa.

154
00:11:21,670 --> 00:11:23,380
Do it for me.

155
00:11:23,630 --> 00:11:26,390
What a nice rhythm. He leaves it to Matsuyama.

156
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:27,510
Matsuyama!

157
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:30,020
Alright, go captain.

158
00:11:30,350 --> 00:11:33,020
Striker Kojiro Hyuga got the ball.

159
00:11:33,100 --> 00:11:34,400
Where's the rush?

160
00:11:34,730 --> 00:11:37,610
He went around him! The ball is going to the corner.

161
00:11:37,980 --> 00:11:39,280
Get ready, Kazuo.

162
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:42,110
But Masao, we've already used the Space Storm twice.

163
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:44,360
We have to. We won't disrupt our attack rhythm.

164
00:11:44,820 --> 00:11:45,950
Alright.

165
00:11:47,990 --> 00:11:49,580
Space Storm!

166
00:11:49,660 --> 00:11:52,080
Oh, that's the third Space Storm today.

167
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:53,210
I'm counting on you.

168
00:11:53,460 --> 00:11:55,080
But Meier is there.

169
00:11:55,250 --> 00:11:57,460
Don't forget Mr. Nita's foot speed.

170
00:11:57,840 --> 00:12:00,710
Oh, Nita sends the ball in front of the goal.

171
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:02,970
The ball finally reached Hyuga.

172
00:12:03,170 --> 00:12:04,090
Come on!

173
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:05,090
Hyuga-kun!

174
00:12:05,550 --> 00:12:07,600
Hamburg goes to block.

175
00:12:07,970 --> 00:12:11,600
The kids gave me this ball, I have to shoot.

176
00:12:14,230 --> 00:12:18,860
Tiger Shot!

177
00:12:20,570 --> 00:12:22,530
And it's stopped!

178
00:12:22,610 --> 00:12:23,530
What!?

179
00:12:23,610 --> 00:12:24,740
Impossible!

180
00:12:24,820 --> 00:12:26,860
Hyuga's Tiger Shot...

181
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,370
Schneider.

182
00:12:29,580 --> 00:12:30,790
No!

183
00:12:31,740 --> 00:12:33,290
Come on, counterattack!

184
00:12:33,370 --> 00:12:34,830
Get back, guys!

185
00:12:34,910 --> 00:12:38,830
Admirable, Wakabayashi. In response to your good play...

186
00:12:43,260 --> 00:12:45,800
Come on, big brother!

187
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:47,800
Marie! So you came.

188
00:12:48,090 --> 00:12:51,060
I have to score the third goal for Marie...

189
00:12:51,470 --> 00:12:53,060
and complete the hat-trick.

190
00:12:58,270 --> 00:12:59,230
Damn it!

191
00:12:59,310 --> 00:13:03,320
He got past the entire Japanese defense, now one-on-one with the goalkeeper.

192
00:13:05,860 --> 00:13:10,950
Goal! Hamburg's third goal and Schneider completes a hat-trick!

193
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:12,700
Big brother!

194
00:13:12,870 --> 00:13:14,700
Yes!

195
00:13:16,250 --> 00:13:17,750
E-extraordinary.

196
00:13:17,830 --> 00:13:21,090
You know him from his data.

197
00:13:21,170 --> 00:13:25,340
Germany's young emperor, Karl Heinz Schneider.

198
00:13:27,930 --> 00:13:28,760
He...

199
00:13:30,090 --> 00:13:31,720
Hey, it can't be!

200
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:33,010
Tsubasa-kun?

201
00:13:33,310 --> 00:13:34,390
Tsubasa!?

202
00:13:34,640 --> 00:13:36,520
Are you serious, it's really Tsubasa!

203
00:13:37,100 --> 00:13:43,270
It's Ozora Tsubasa, appearing unexpectedly on the sidelines at the European tournament.

204
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:46,030
What!? Why are you here!?

205
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:49,910
I couldn't resist, I came to play with you.

206
00:13:50,110 --> 00:13:51,570
Hurry up, get in the game.

207
00:13:51,660 --> 00:13:53,030
We need you, Tsubasa.

208
00:13:53,450 --> 00:13:54,870
Your leg...

209
00:13:54,950 --> 00:13:57,750
It was because of the third Space Storm.

210
00:13:58,080 --> 00:14:00,540
I think it was too much for our legs.

211
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:02,540
So you made it, Tsubasa.

212
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:04,050
Wakabayashi-kun.

213
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:10,840
Tsubasa and Wakabayashi. It's been three years.

214
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:17,430
Tsubasa, I've been looking forward to our duel.

215
00:14:18,350 --> 00:14:25,020
So that's the prodigy Ozora Tsubasa that Wakabayashi always talks about.

216
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:29,150
Wait. Tsubasa can't come and play!

217
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:30,240
Hyuga-kun.

218
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:31,450
Hey, Hyuga.

219
00:14:31,860 --> 00:14:34,950
I let you take the number 10.

220
00:14:35,330 --> 00:14:38,960
But Tsubasa has no right to play in this match right now.

221
00:14:39,250 --> 00:14:41,500
I agree with Hyuga.

222
00:14:41,580 --> 00:14:43,080
Why, Matsuyama?

223
00:14:43,580 --> 00:14:47,210
We are here because we were selected from camp.

224
00:14:47,550 --> 00:14:51,220
If Tsubasa plays, what about the guys who weren't selected?

225
00:14:51,470 --> 00:14:56,600
Tsubasa couldn't come because he was injured, you know he can play.

226
00:14:56,760 --> 00:15:01,100
They are three goals ahead right now. We need Tsubasa to win.

227
00:15:01,190 --> 00:15:04,560
- Only Tsubasa can stop Wakabayashi-san... - The match isn't over!

228
00:15:05,820 --> 00:15:08,940
I said we'll win.

229
00:15:09,030 --> 00:15:10,950
We don't need Tsubasa's help.

230
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:15,490
If we can't win, I'll take responsibility and resign as captain.

231
00:15:16,410 --> 00:15:17,330
Tsubasa.

232
00:15:17,410 --> 00:15:18,790
Coach Mikami.

233
00:15:18,870 --> 00:15:23,250
Sorry, but the whole team must approve you playing.

234
00:15:23,460 --> 00:15:25,250
I can't allow it.

235
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:27,250
I understand.

236
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:31,090
Sorimachi and Sano will take the field in place of the Tachibana brothers.

237
00:15:31,170 --> 00:15:32,220
Yes, coach.

238
00:15:32,300 --> 00:15:37,510
Guys, play with all your strength! As Hyuga said, you haven't lost yet.

239
00:15:37,850 --> 00:15:39,680
Keep fighting.

240
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:41,980
The match resumes.

241
00:15:42,060 --> 00:15:45,400
Sorimachi and Sano are on the field for the Tachibana brothers.

242
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:48,020
Looks like Tsubasa isn't playing.

243
00:15:48,270 --> 00:15:49,480
What?

244
00:15:49,570 --> 00:15:55,030
Why? Japan team, I told you, without Tsubasa you have no chance.

245
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,950
I know, Wakabayashi.

246
00:15:59,040 --> 00:16:05,290
But this team was built without Tsubasa. We can't ask for his help now.

247
00:16:05,830 --> 00:16:08,630
You've recovered, Tsubasa-kun.

248
00:16:08,920 --> 00:16:10,050
Misugi-kun.

249
00:16:11,550 --> 00:16:14,010
It's too early to say that.

250
00:16:15,180 --> 00:16:18,350
What Hyuga and Matsuyama said is right.

251
00:16:18,430 --> 00:16:24,560
I was only thinking about myself, not the team.

252
00:16:24,850 --> 00:16:31,570
I thought if I came here I could play right away. I was stupid.

253
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:36,320
Sorimachi.

254
00:16:36,570 --> 00:16:38,070
The ball is going towards Sorimachi.

255
00:16:38,370 --> 00:16:40,450
Oh, Schneider is there again.

256
00:16:44,580 --> 00:16:48,540
Kaltz, the goalkeeper is injured, they'll concede.

257
00:16:48,790 --> 00:16:50,040
Okay.

258
00:16:50,710 --> 00:16:53,210
Kaltz shoots from a good position.

259
00:16:53,760 --> 00:16:55,510
Wakashimazu makes a great save.

260
00:16:55,590 --> 00:16:56,930
Well done, Wakashimazu.

261
00:16:58,970 --> 00:17:03,600
What happened? Blood is dripping from Wakashimazu's right hand.

262
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:04,560
Wakashimazu-kun!

263
00:17:04,640 --> 00:17:05,810
Wakashimazu!

264
00:17:05,890 --> 00:17:09,810
I think he injured it while stopping Schneider's third goal.

265
00:17:10,310 --> 00:17:11,980
Morizaki, get on the field.

266
00:17:12,070 --> 00:17:14,690
- Yes, coach. - Wait, I'm staying.

267
00:17:15,110 --> 00:17:19,450
As the captain said, we haven't lost yet. The game starts now.

268
00:17:19,870 --> 00:17:22,700
I understand how you feel, but you're really injured.

269
00:17:22,950 --> 00:17:24,950
We need a doctor immediately.

270
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:26,960
I'll take him.

271
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:28,330
Please, Katagiri-kun.

272
00:17:28,790 --> 00:17:31,090
Then treat me right here.

273
00:17:31,420 --> 00:17:36,260
I want to return to the field. This time I'll stop Schneider's shot.

274
00:17:36,340 --> 00:17:37,550
Wakashimazu.

275
00:17:37,970 --> 00:17:39,050
Captain.

276
00:17:39,340 --> 00:17:41,100
Not with that right hand.

277
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:43,680
Leave the rest to us.

278
00:17:46,310 --> 00:17:47,560
Alright.

279
00:17:48,350 --> 00:17:52,110
Play resumes with goalkeeper Morizaki entering.

280
00:17:54,860 --> 00:17:57,360
Okay guys, forward!

281
00:18:02,950 --> 00:18:07,000
I understand how you feel right now.

282
00:18:07,410 --> 00:18:08,500
Misugi-kun.

283
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:12,420
You want to run and play on the field but you can't.

284
00:18:12,500 --> 00:18:16,210
But I didn't just sit here on the bench.

285
00:18:16,710 --> 00:18:21,090
I always compared my own game with what was happening on the field.

286
00:18:27,060 --> 00:18:29,390
I haven't given up on wearing the Japan jersey,

287
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:32,150
on being on the pitch, which is my dream.

288
00:18:33,150 --> 00:18:36,400
Schneider scores a double hat-trick!

289
00:18:36,530 --> 00:18:38,150
Score 6-0.

290
00:18:38,610 --> 00:18:43,660
Less than 5 minutes left, it's impossible for Japan to win now.

291
00:18:45,870 --> 00:18:48,500
Be strong, fight, Japan Team!

292
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:50,000
Tsubasa.

293
00:18:50,290 --> 00:18:52,420
I've never felt this way.

294
00:18:52,540 --> 00:18:56,670
Even if I'm just a backup goalkeeper, I want to play!

295
00:18:57,760 --> 00:19:00,300
It's over. We lost.

296
00:19:01,220 --> 00:19:07,430
That's Japan's youth for you. We can't compete on this stage.

297
00:19:08,220 --> 00:19:10,480
We suffered a humiliating defeat against Hamburg,

298
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:15,570
Europe's number one team, in front of Emperor Schneider.

299
00:19:15,980 --> 00:19:16,980
Intercepted!

300
00:19:17,070 --> 00:19:18,440
Matsuyama, pass!

301
00:19:18,530 --> 00:19:22,070
He intercepts the pass between Schneider and Kaltz in front of Japan's goal.

302
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:23,950
What!?

303
00:19:24,030 --> 00:19:27,080
We play with all our strength until the final whistle.

304
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:30,200
That is the spirit of Japan's youth.

305
00:19:30,870 --> 00:19:32,210
Right.

306
00:19:33,830 --> 00:19:35,170
Hyuga-san.

307
00:19:35,710 --> 00:19:36,540
Takeshi.

308
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:38,630
Hyuga got the ball.

309
00:19:38,710 --> 00:19:42,050
One minute left! Can Japan pull one back?

310
00:19:42,130 --> 00:19:43,720
Come on, Hyuga-kun!

311
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:44,930
Bring it on, Hyuga.

312
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:47,350
Catch, here I come, Wakabayashi!

313
00:19:47,430 --> 00:19:49,810
A shot from outside the box.

314
00:19:49,930 --> 00:19:54,190
Shoot, Hyuga. You've never finished a match without a goal.

315
00:19:54,650 --> 00:20:00,440
Right. While I was giving up, the guys kept this ball alive.

316
00:20:01,690 --> 00:20:04,490
Oh, he didn't shoot, he went forward.

317
00:20:05,030 --> 00:20:06,700
The right decision, Hyuga-kun.

318
00:20:06,990 --> 00:20:08,450
Cut him off! Shut him down!

319
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:15,710
Hyuga is dribbling. Did he want this goal that badly?

320
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:18,710
Now he's face to face with Wakabayashi.

321
00:20:21,130 --> 00:20:25,090
Take this, Wakabayashi! Tiger Shot!

322
00:20:25,470 --> 00:20:29,060
Goal! Wakabayashi couldn't move at all.

323
00:20:29,140 --> 00:20:33,100
Japan finally scored a goal against Hamburg!

324
00:20:33,310 --> 00:20:34,520
Great shot!

325
00:20:34,600 --> 00:20:35,480
Hyuga-san.

326
00:20:35,810 --> 00:20:40,230
Your shot was amazing, Hyuga-kun. Even Wakabayashi couldn't catch it.

327
00:20:40,570 --> 00:20:43,990
You did it perfectly, Hyuga.

328
00:20:45,740 --> 00:20:47,490
The match is over.

329
00:20:48,030 --> 00:20:50,030
A double hat-trick.

330
00:20:50,120 --> 00:20:52,750
Yeah, it's clear Japan isn't a match.

331
00:20:54,620 --> 00:20:55,710
You chickened out.

332
00:20:55,790 --> 00:20:57,040
What?

333
00:20:57,420 --> 00:21:00,380
I thought you'd shoot from outside the penalty area.

334
00:21:00,460 --> 00:21:01,800
That's pathetic.

335
00:21:02,420 --> 00:21:06,260
You ran away from our duel and scored such a worthless goal.

336
00:21:06,470 --> 00:21:07,550
What!?

337
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:13,350
It doesn't matter. Consider it a gift for coming all the way from Japan.

338
00:21:13,810 --> 00:21:20,270
With your current team, you won't win a single match in the tournament.

339
00:21:20,520 --> 00:21:21,520
Bastard.

340
00:21:24,070 --> 00:21:25,190
Wakabayashi.

341
00:21:25,280 --> 00:21:27,860
When you can't beat me in football, you choose to fight?

342
00:21:27,950 --> 00:21:29,910
Y-you bastard!

343
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:33,370
Hyuga-san!

344
00:21:33,450 --> 00:21:34,910
Stop it, both of you.

345
00:21:35,080 --> 00:21:36,330
Calm down, Hyuga.

346
00:21:36,410 --> 00:21:37,420
Enough.

347
00:21:37,540 --> 00:21:39,290
That's enough, Wakabayashi.

348
00:21:39,540 --> 00:21:41,290
Hyuga-kun, Wakabayashi-kun.

349
00:21:43,670 --> 00:21:46,630
Alright, let me go.

350
00:21:51,050 --> 00:21:52,140
Matsuyama.

351
00:21:57,690 --> 00:22:03,690
This is what you wanted, wasn't it, Mikami-san?

352
00:23:45,470 --> 00:24:49,900
Next episode: A Fresh Start from Zero